DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45146::$$$message_0407_0000_0000$$$::"Kiritsugu Emiya! You finally dare show yourself before me, scum! I'll never let you have the wish granter! This is for burning down my workshop!"::
45147::$$$message_0407_0000_0001$$$::"You can just order a new one."::
45148::$$$message_0407_0000_0002$$$::"PISS OFF! [wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=ケイネス face=怒2 pos=left time=400 twno=2][hfangry layer=0]How dare you! Trash like you doesn't deserve to win! I will prove to you, with this hanafuda, that I am the best!"::
45149::$$$message_0407_0000_0003$$$::"Thanks for going out of your way. Sorry, Iri."::
45150::$$$message_0407_0000_0004$$$::"I know, Kiritsugu. We'll start by destroying the Reality Marble on his forehead."::
45151::$$$message_0407_0000_0005$$$::"REEEEEE!"::
45152::$$$message_0407_0000_0006$$$::"Kayneth, the enemy has long hair! I mean, a long range! One wrong move, and your follicles, I mean, your scalp, uh, er..."::
45153::$$$message_0407_0000_0007$$$::"Not you too, Sola-Ui!"::
45154::$$$message_0407_0000_0008$$$::"I've been eager for this moment... We are the last two Servants! It's time to settle this, Lancer!"::
45155::$$$message_0407_0000_0009$$$::"Nothing would make me happier, Saber!"::
45156::$$$message_0407_0000_0010$$$::"Wait, Lancer. Your role here is done. I said that I will be doing the fighting."::
45157::$$$message_0407_0000_0011$$$::"But, my lord!"::
45158::$$$message_0407_0000_0012$$$::"If Lancer will not wield his spears, then I have no reason to take up my sword."::
45159::$$$message_0407_0000_0013$$$::"What..?[wvl canskip=false time=400][hffgchg2 chara=切嗣 face=笑顔 pos=center time=300 twno=1][hfsigh layer=2] Fine. I'll just use a Command Spell to make you finish him off."::
45160::$$$message_0407_0000_0014$$$::"Kiritsugu! I can't believe you!"::
45161::$$$message_0407_0000_0015$$$::"Hmm, I'm not sure if Command Spells work in this game, but we don't have any more."::
45162::$$$message_0407_0000_0016$$$::"Oh?"::
45163::$$$message_0407_0000_0017$$$::"We were at a restaurant with all-you-can-eat sushi, barbeque, and crab legs, so I had to use them all to pull Saber away. It was good food, though."::
45164::$$$message_0407_0000_0018$$$::"Ma..."::
45165::$$$message_0407_0000_0019$$$::"Maiya! I need you here, Maiya!"::
45166::$$$message_0407_0000_0020$$$::"Lord Kayneth, please reconsider!"::
45167::$$$message_0407_0000_0021$$$::"Hmph. What use is empty chivalry? Have my deeds proven to you that I am worthy to be your Master?"::
45168::$$$message_0407_0000_0022$$$::"Lord Kayneth..."::
45169::$$$message_0407_0000_0023$$$::"You've served me well, Diarmuid Ua Duibhne. Now it's my turn to repay your loyalty. A noble must bear the weight of all who serve him, by standing on the front lines."::
45170::$$$message_0407_0000_0024$$$::"Do not ask me to forsake my chivalry."::
45171::$$$message_0407_0000_0025$$$::"Lord..."::
45172::$$$message_0407_0000_0026$$$::"...I cannot comply, my lord. Nothing is more important to me than my vow to bring you victory."::
45173::$$$message_0407_0000_0027$$$::"Please, forgive my insolence for fighting by your side!"::
45174::$$$message_0407_0000_0028$$$::"You blind fool. Do what you will."::
45175::$$$message_0407_0000_0029$$$::"What an unexpected joy. You've chosen the wrong man to serve, Saber!"::
45176::$$$message_0407_0000_0030$$$::"I already know that! So what!?"::
45177::$$$message_0407_0000_0031$$$::"I'm saying that your tragic chivalry is unworthy to cross blades with my spear. This mole will do."::
45178::$$$message_0407_0000_0032$$$::"Aww..."::

